    "当前签名无法访问钥匙串（-34018）。密码仅在本次 App 运行期间保留，App 重新启动后需重新输入。若要长期保存，请使用具有钥匙串访问权限的有效签名重新安装。": {
      "comment": "S007 | App/AirPlayCredentials.swift:17",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前签名无法访问钥匙串（-34018）。密码仅在本次 App 运行期间保留，App 重新启动后需重新输入。若要长期保存，请使用具有钥匙串访问权限的有效签名重新安装。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The current signing profile cannot access Keychain (-34018). The password is kept only while the app is running and must be entered again after restarting the app. To save it permanently, reinstall the app with a valid signing profile that allows Keychain access."
          }
        }
      }
    },
