            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start from the HTTP Receiver Page"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在接收设备上打开 HTTP 接收页，点「配置 HTTPS」，再按页面步骤为该设备安装证书。": {
      "comment": "S536 | App/ReceiverViewController.swift:2095",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在接收设备上打开 HTTP 接收页，点「配置 HTTPS」，再按页面步骤为该设备安装证书。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open the HTTP receiver page on the receiving device, tap “Set Up HTTPS”, and follow the instructions to install a certificate on that device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone 和 iPad": {
      "comment": "S537 | App/ReceiverViewController.swift:2096",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 和 iPad"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone and iPad"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下载描述文件后，在系统设置安装，再前往「通用 › 关于本机 › 证书信任设置」开启完全信任，最后打开 HTTPS 地址。": {
      "comment": "S538 | App/ReceiverViewController.swift:2096",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载描述文件后，在系统设置安装，再前往「通用 › 关于本机 › 证书信任设置」开启完全信任，最后打开 HTTPS 地址。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After downloading the profile, install it in system Settings. Go to General › About › Certificate Trust Settings, enable full trust, then open the HTTPS address."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下载 Android 证书，按接收页指引在系统设置中安装为 CA 证书，再打开 HTTPS 地址。系统菜单名称随品牌而异。": {
      "comment": "S539 | App/ReceiverViewController.swift:2097",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载 Android 证书，按接收页指引在系统设置中安装为 CA 证书，再打开 HTTPS 地址。系统菜单名称随品牌而异。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Download the Android certificate and follow the receiver page’s instructions to install it as a CA certificate in system Settings. Then open the HTTPS address. Menu names vary by manufacturer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
