    "启动时先用勾选的屏幕或最近一次设置。第一个网页接管后，窗口尺寸变化会在 CarWithin 回到前台时应用。更大的窗口按最高分辨率等比缩小。": {
      "comment": "S584 | App/ReceiverViewController.swift:2288",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启动时先用勾选的屏幕或最近一次设置。第一个网页接管后，窗口尺寸变化会在 CarWithin 回到前台时应用。更大的窗口按最高分辨率等比缩小。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Startup uses the selected display or the most recent settings. After the first browser takes control, window size changes are applied when CarWithin returns to the foreground. Larger windows are scaled proportionally to fit the maximum resolution."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "选择比例后按分辨率档位计算尺寸，短边至少 320 像素，实际值见下方。2K/4K 会增加发热和带宽。": {
      "comment": "S585 | App/ReceiverViewController.swift:2289",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择比例后按分辨率档位计算尺寸，短边至少 320 像素，实际值见下方。2K/4K 会增加发热和带宽。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The selected aspect ratio and resolution determine the video size, with a minimum short side of 320 pixels. See the actual size below. 2K/4K increases heat and bandwidth use."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n此输出受 1920×1080 限制，较长的竖屏比例以实际尺寸为准。": {
      "comment": "S586 | App/ReceiverViewController.swift:2290",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n此输出受 1920×1080 限制，较长的竖屏比例以实际尺寸为准。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\nThis output is limited to 1920×1080. For tall portrait aspect ratios, refer to the actual size."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自动帧率根据主网页选择 30 或 60 FPS。支持 H.265 的主网页会优先使用 H.265。": {
      "comment": "S588 | App/ReceiverViewController.swift:2292",
      "extractionState": "manual",
