    "浏览器画面持续卡顿时，自动以更轻的画面重启 CarPlay（先降到 30 FPS，再降到 720P），每次连接最多两次。": {
      "comment": "S591 | App/ReceiverViewController.swift:2296",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "浏览器画面持续卡顿时，自动以更轻的画面重启 CarPlay（先降到 30 FPS，再降到 720P），每次连接最多两次。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If browser video keeps stuttering, restart CarPlay automatically with lower video settings: first 30 FPS, then 720P. Limited to two restarts per connection."
          }
        }
      }
    },
