    "让 iPhone 加入仪表 Wi-Fi，选择同名预设。结束其他投屏，打开仪表投屏后启动 CarPlay。声音由 iPhone 或蓝牙输出。": {
      "comment": "S635 | App/ReceiverViewController.swift:2579",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
