    "iPhone 连上仪表 Wi-Fi，选择对应预设，先在 CarWithin 启动本机 CarPlay。没有画面时，保持 CarWithin 运行，再到九号出行开启投屏导航。": {
      "comment": "S637 | App/ReceiverViewController.swift:2586",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 连上仪表 Wi-Fi，选择对应预设，先在 CarWithin 启动本机 CarPlay。没有画面时，保持 CarWithin 运行，再到九号出行开启投屏导航。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect the iPhone to the dashboard’s Wi-Fi and select the matching preset. Start CarPlay on this iPhone in CarWithin first. If no video appears, keep CarWithin running and enable navigation projection in the Ninebot app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仪表出画后，可尝试从多任务界面划掉九号出行；若仪表随之退出投屏，则该型号需要保留官方会话。": {
      "comment": "S638 | App/ReceiverViewController.swift:2589",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
