            "value": "仪表出画后，可尝试从多任务界面划掉九号出行；若仪表随之退出投屏，则该型号需要保留官方会话。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once video appears on the dashboard, try swiping away the Ninebot app in the app switcher. If projection stops, this model requires the official app’s session to stay active."
          }
        }
      }
    },
