    "适用于 TL-DASH-V2 仪表。iPhone 加入仪表 Wi-Fi，在「Wi-Fi 与网络」填写该网络信息；开启仪表投屏后启动 CarPlay。请先退出其他投屏 App。": {
      "comment": "S659 | App/ReceiverViewController.swift:2700",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "适用于 TL-DASH-V2 仪表。iPhone 加入仪表 Wi-Fi，在「Wi-Fi 与网络」填写该网络信息；开启仪表投屏后启动 CarPlay。请先退出其他投屏 App。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For TL-DASH-V2 dashboards. Connect the iPhone to the dashboard’s Wi-Fi and enter its network details under “Wi-Fi & Network”. Enable screen projection on the dashboard, then start CarPlay. Close other screen projection apps first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仪表输出固定为 480×272、JPEG，最高 20 FPS。本机 CarPlay 使用 H.264、960×544、30 FPS。声音由 iPhone／蓝牙输出；仪表不回传触控。": {
      "comment": "S660 | App/ReceiverViewController.swift:2703",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仪表输出固定为 480×272、JPEG，最高 20 FPS。本机 CarPlay 使用 H.264、960×544、30 FPS。声音由 iPhone／蓝牙输出；仪表不回传触控。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dashboard output is fixed at 480×272 JPEG, up to 20 FPS. CarPlay on this iPhone uses H.264 at 960×544 and 30 FPS. Audio plays through the iPhone or Bluetooth; the dashboard does not send touch input back."
          }
        }
      }
    },
