    "地址根据手机当前 IP 自动生成，无需账号；DNS 解析需要网络。仍需在接收设备信任本机根证书。只改变域名，不保证绕过特斯拉的私网限制。": {
      "comment": "S684 | App/ReceiverViewController.swift:2776",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地址根据手机当前 IP 自动生成，无需账号；DNS 解析需要网络。仍需在接收设备信任本机根证书。只改变域名，不保证绕过特斯拉的私网限制。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The address is generated from the phone’s current IP; no account is needed. DNS resolution requires network access. You must still trust this device’s root certificate on the receiver. This only changes the domain name and does not guarantee bypassing Tesla’s private network restrictions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先在 duckdns.org 注册自己的域名。Token 可修改账号中的域名，请像密码一样保管；仅保存在本机 Keychain。此处将域名指向当前局域网地址，不开放公网端口。": {
      "comment": "S685 | App/ReceiverViewController.swift:2780",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先在 duckdns.org 注册自己的域名。Token 可修改账号中的域名，请像密码一样保管；仅保存在本机 Keychain。此处将域名指向当前局域网地址，不开放公网端口。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Register your own domain at duckdns.org first. The token can modify domains in your account, so keep it secure like a password. It is stored only in this device’s Keychain. This points the domain to the current local network address and does not open any public ports."
          }
        }
      }
    },
