    "使用 ACME DNS-01 等方式在外部申请该域名的公开证书，导出包含私钥与完整证书链的 P12 后导入。当前不自动签发或续期；到期后需重新导入。仅在本机受信任不能保证车机信任；域名和证书也不能保证绕过车机的私网限制。": {
      "comment": "S690 | App/ReceiverViewController.swift:2786",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 ACME DNS-01 等方式在外部申请该域名的公开证书，导出包含私钥与完整证书链的 P12 后导入。当前不自动签发或续期；到期后需重新导入。仅在本机受信任不能保证车机信任；域名和证书也不能保证绕过车机的私网限制。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Obtain a public certificate for this domain externally, for example using ACME DNS-01. Export a P12 containing the private key and full certificate chain, then import it. Automatic issuance and renewal are not supported; import a new certificate when it expires. Trust on this device does not guarantee trust on the head unit. Neither the domain nor the certificate guarantees bypassing the head unit’s private network restrictions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
